Build dependency
The project's only build dependency is the MoonBit standard library,
package `moonbitlang/core`, which is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Test-only oracles (not part of the product)
The test suite uses the following third-party libraries purely as
differential-testing oracles. They are never linked into, bundled with, or
copied by the product:

  * `jsonrepair` (npm package `jsonrepair`) — TypeScript/JavaScript,
    licensed under ISC.
  * `json-repair` (PyPI package `json-repair`) — Python, licensed under MIT.

No source code from either library is included in this repository or in any
build artifact; they are executed out of process solely to compare behavior,
and their output is used for test reporting and documentation of intentional
divergences.

Licenses were verified on 2026-10-14 against the npm registry metadata for
`jsonrepair` 3.15.0 and the PyPI metadata and repository LICENSE for
`json-repair` 0.64.0.
